    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37050" root="كعسب" body-key="k">
    
      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَعْسَبَ</span></b>  <i>He ran</i> (K) <i>vehemently:</i> like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَعْظَلَ</span>: (TA:) <i>and fled:</i> (K:) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَعْسَمَ</span>:
(TA:) or <i>he ran slowly:</i> or <i>he walked quickly:</i>
or <i>he walked in the manner of a drunken man.</i>
(K.)

